+/* RK3576 SAI2 shares ONE slot clock between TX and RX: if the two streams ask
+ * for a DIFFERENT slot count (mono capture + stereo playback) the RX frame
+ * accounting doubles and the whole capture runs at 2x speed (measured 32006 Hz
+ * for a nominal 16000 Hz stream), which silently breaks ASR/KWS/VAD tuning.
+ * Measured on this board: 1ch/1ch and 2ch/2ch are 1.000x, mixed is not.
+ * -> capture is opened as STEREO as well and downmixed to mono below. */
+#define ALSA_CAPTURE_CHANNELS    (2)
